      "intent": "chat",
      "capability": "chat",
      "engine": "llm-gateway",
      "degraded": false,
      "success": true,
      "latency_ms": 1115,
      "answer_text": "“宁为玉碎，不为瓦全”中的“宁”意思是“宁可、宁愿”，表示在两者之间选择前者，即使付出代价也愿意。因此，最接近的选项是 **B. 宁可、宁愿**。",
      "answer_sha256": "4d5a83c7f12d4663bcf5bfd1b28e9a92a78df5750c021639972b15e0bddc390f",
      "score_strict": true,
